    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704550/extras/6443c482c9028db9c1019b2690813cca.poster.avif?t=1750760591\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704550/extras/6443c482c9028db9c1019b2690813cca.webm?t=1750760591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704550/extras/6443c482c9028db9c1019b2690813cca.mp4?t=1750760591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a spooky lodge or laboratory. <br>And use pistols, rifles, rocket launchers and other weapons to fight monsters and escape.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Full support of 4K HDR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TEST RE features full support of 4K HDR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compatibility with 16bit HDR implements a gorgeous presentation that goes beyond usual HDR. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0An evolved sound system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real Sound Effect(RSE) was experimentally introduced to previous works, and received extraordinarily high ratings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now it's evolved to Enhance Real Sound Effect(ERSE).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Horror productions that featured 3D Space Audio were able to be transformed into completely new horror experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Translator:Richard Lenerz </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special Thanks:Tobias Nitsch &amp; Steve Russell</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704550/extras/6443c482c9028db9c1019b2690813cca.poster.avif?t=1750760591\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704550/extras/6443c482c9028db9c1019b2690813cca.webm?t=1750760591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704550/extras/6443c482c9028db9c1019b2690813cca.mp4?t=1750760591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a spooky lodge or laboratory. <br>And use pistols, rifles, rocket launchers and other weapons to fight monsters and escape.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Full support of 4K HDR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TEST RE features full support of 4K HDR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compatibility with 16bit HDR implements a gorgeous presentation that goes beyond usual HDR. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0An evolved sound system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real Sound Effect(RSE) was experimentally introduced to previous works, and received extraordinarily high ratings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now it's evolved to Enhance Real Sound Effect(ERSE).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Horror productions that featured 3D Space Audio were able to be transformed into completely new horror experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Translator:Richard Lenerz </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special Thanks:Tobias Nitsch &amp; Steve Russell</p>",
